Spectral Neurologix Info (SN_Inf??.LHA) -- Why?

To cut down on the size of each archive and instead of duplicating files
with each of my releases, the following files, in their most up-to-date
form, are located in SN_Inf??.lha and will be uploaded whenever significant
changes have been made.

SupportNote.readme                Latest information regarding my location
SupportNote.readme.info           and how to contact me for support.

MyPGPKey.txt                      My PGP public key for verifying the main
MyPGPKey.txt.info                 file(s) of my releases.

SN_Files.txt                      The current list of SN PFiles available,
SN_Files.txt.info                 still in the works and on the drawing board.

SN_FilesInfo.txt                  A companion to the above listing, gives
SN_FilesInfo.txt.info             a short description of each of the PFiles.


Well, that's all.  Hopefully this will help.  Instead of wandering which one
of the several of the above are the most reliable, all you need to do is
grab the highest version of SN Info and there you go...

Midnight (Phil Beazley)
01/09/96
